	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030040"},
		line=1970,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"We receive a summons from Elsa during our lunch break.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Hotori and I are told to make our way to the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"It's safe to assume this is somehow related to the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So, what do you think she's after?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Given that she went to the trouble of summoning us by letter, she must want to keep it a secret.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maybe she wants some life advice?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm happy to give advice on hers as long as she doesn't intend to end ours.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"On full alert, Hotori carefully knocks on the door to the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Come in.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Excuse us.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Standing beside the window, Elsa slowly turns around to face us.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Her blonde hair shimmers in the sunlight.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"There's likely some truth to the rumor that she's overwhelmingly popular amongst the men in the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Even I would probably turn my head if we were to pass each other in the streets─at least, assuming I didn't know who she really was.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Welcome. Your ≪host≫ has been waiting for you.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Elsa gestures towards a most unexpected personage seated behind her.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well met, Inou. Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Uhh... ah...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Hotori feebly flaps her mouth open and closed like a fish.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"What in the world is Empress Hisui doing here?",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, go on and take a seat.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mmgh, hmm, I-I...”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I think I'll stay standing...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, you're in the presence of the Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I take initiative and kneel at once.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"To anyone who doesn't know about Akari, Empress Hisui is the true Empress.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"If we don't show our proper respect, Elsa will be rightfully suspicious.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"We absolutely have to act as though Empress Hisui is the genuine article.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, I am most pleased that you have granted me an audience once again.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Somewhat slow on the uptake, Hotori nonetheless follows suit.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Head of House Inou, Inou Hotori. At your service.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It is a true honor to gaze upon your countenance.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"It seems like she's caught on.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As Elsa-sama said, please do have a seat.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That would be best if we are to talk comfortably, would it not?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, uhh...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well. Please excuse us.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I not-so-subtly nudge Hotori to sit down.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"She tends to get tongue-tied even at the best of times, so she must be struggling with this unexpected situation.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"I'll have to handle the talking here.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks for taking the time out of your busy schedules to meet us.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In truth, it was actually Her Majesty who wanted to have a chat with you two.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What business might you have with us, Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"I look up and meet eyes with Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Wordlessly, she continues staring at me.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I think back to the day we first met in the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Back then, she was also staring at me just like this.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"It appears that, in some way or other, she has me on her mind.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah, excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Empress Hisui distractedly clears her throat, her snow-white cheeks taking on a faint flush.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would make a request of the head of House Inou, the Executor of the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I wish for you to strike down Chancellor Okonogi Tokihiko.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...The chancellor?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Hotori gawks at Empress Hisui, as though trying to comprehend the true intentions behind her declaration.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"The false Empress has requested that the warriors vanquish Okonogi, her own keeper.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Right in front of Elsa─the daughter of the governor-general, no less.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't blame you for being so shocked.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But this really is what Empress Hisui wants.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And I, for one, am entirely on board with Her Majesty here.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Elsa declares all this with a composed smirk, seemingly having already come to an accord with Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, if we may, we would hear your reasoning.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That man is an obstacle to the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I wish to restore peace to the land and remake the Empire as a democracy.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However, Okonogi is concerned only with lining his own pockets and rejects all attempts at reform.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Under his rule, the people will continue to suffer great misfortune.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Thus, I insist that he be removed from his seat of power.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you share in my aspirations, I would ask your cooperation.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By democracy, do you mean a system of governance similar to that of the Republic?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If so, I would like to know what is to become of Your\nMajesty's position in this new government.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Rather than Empress Hisui, Elsa is the one to answer my question.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Her Majesty wishes to abolish the Imperial institution.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“She would put an end to the traditional system of hereditary rule and create a new social order where all citizens may contribute to governance on equal standing.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Hotori glares sharply at Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Since time immemorial, we have faithfully served the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We refuse to be complicit in a conspiracy that would depose our own lord.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even if Empress Hisui is personally requesting your help?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What sort of warrior would turn down a request from Her Majesty herself?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"She puts a perfectly manicured fingernail to her chin as she retorts with a smirk.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks for your time.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hold it now...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I put a stop to Hotori right as she's about to kick her chair over.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"We won't get a second chance if she storms out now.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"For the sake of the Sworn Blades, we should try to gather as much information as we can.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, the suddenness of this request has us rather uneasy.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If it pleases you, would you explain your intentions to us in greater detail?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, if you would.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you for keeping your cool, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyway, Her Majesty ultimately wishes to establish democracy in the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Okonogi stands in the way of that, so she needs you to take care of him.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In return, assuming the coup d'etat goes off without a hitch, the warriors' social status will be guaranteed.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You'll all be provided suitable positions within the new regime.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And on top of that...”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The warriors will be granted a full pardon for all the crimes they've committed.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Though she declares this rather dispassionately, I can see a barely concealed fire raging within her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Those very same eyes carefully watch for my and Hotori's reactions.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Ever since the war, we've been fighting a vicious insurgency against the Republican Army that's cost many lives on both sides.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"For someone like Elsa, this must be a hefty concession to make.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What crimes might we need to be pardoned for?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm not accusing you personally, but are you going to pretend that none of your compatriots have ever turned their blades on Republican soldiers?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Treason against the state, seditious conspiracy, obstruction of justice, assault with a bladed weapon... I could go on.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First time I've heard about any of this.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Elsa snorts and rolls her eyes at my attempt to play dumb.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, why do the warriors need to be the ones to deal with Okonogi?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It should be a simple matter for the Republican Army to depose him.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Regime change has to be achieved at the hands of the Imperial people.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Imperials themselves need to be seen taking a stand and joining with Empress Hisui in rebuilding the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Democracy will never take root in the Empire unless it comes about organically.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I believe it is just as Elsa-sama says.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's deep trust for Elsa is incredibly evident as she nods along to her words.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Is this what Empress Hisui wants of her own accord? Or did she get sweet-talked into it by Elsa?",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"After all, Empress Hisui is Okonogi's puppet in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Elsa could very well have exploited her dissatisfaction with her life as a puppet Empress by giving her a noble-sounding cause to latch on to.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is the Republican Army on board with this plot?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The governor-general has granted his approval, of course. You have nothing to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, what sort of support can we expect from the Republican Army?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As much as we are capable of.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“More specifically?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Mainly military matters.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm sure you're already aware of this, but right now, I am the person in charge of security for the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“When the time comes, I will see to it that the warriors encounter no opposition.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You'll have a clear path straight to Okonogi. It'll be as easy as walking through the front door to claim your prize.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"At the Blades' current strength, we couldn't possibly take on the Imperial Palace if it were under the Republican\nArmy's protection.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"If Elsa is telling the truth, then this is a fantastic opportunity.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"But if Elsa intends to betray us, she'll be able to wipe us out in one fell swoop.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well. Hypothetically, say we were willing to cooperate with Her Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, hold it!”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I said ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"hypothetically.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In any case, the warriors frankly have zero trust for the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In order for us to get them on board with your plan, we'd need a way to prove that you're acting in good faith.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What guarantee do we have that the Republican Army\nwon't betray us?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, you have my word... But I suppose talk is cheap,\nisn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll need more than that.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"For most warriors, Elsa is their archnemesis.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll accommodate whatever demands you have to the best of my ability. How about that?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So, what can I do for you?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, why don't you start by returning all the spellblades the Republic has confiscated from us?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Elsa's eyebrows twitch at this outrageous demand.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"If we get our spellblades back, our fighting strength will skyrocket.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"It should be an inconceivable concession for her to make if\nshe's planning to eventually crush us.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll make the arrangements.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But in exchange, I'll want a named roster of warriors who are willing to cooperate.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Surely I can get away with asking for that much in return,\ncan't I?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, I'm going to need to be able to give some legitimate reason for requisitioning captured spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"This concession must be close to Elsa's limits.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Hotori seems to be just as shocked as I am at this unexpected development.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Now, how do we respond?",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I take a moment to consider the state of affairs.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades' ultimate goal is to rescue Empress Hisui from Okonogi's clutches and restore the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Our plan up until now has been to first storm the Imperial Palace, neutralize Okonogi, and whisk Empress Hisui away.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Next, we would bring Her Majesty to Iseya, establish a provisional government, and declare independence from the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Empress Hisui would then issue a call to arms to the 200,000 members of the Imperial Police, the warriors outside the Blades, and other brave patriots.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"If independence movements were to flare up all across the Empire, the Republic would have no choice but to sit down for negotiations.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Of course, the terms of the eventual settlement would depend on how much our insurrection could force the Republic to concede ground.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"It's a plan that hangs on a blade's edge, but it's the only way we have to take on the Republic's 160,000 troops with our two hundred-strong force.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I personally want to put Akari on the Imperial Throne, but\nthere's no rush for that.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Once the situation settles down, it should be a simple matter to use the Three Sacred Treasures to prove her lineage.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"With all that in mind...",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Up to the point of defeating Okonogi, Elsa and Empress\nHisui's plot is perfectly aligned with our own goals.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"As long as they're telling the truth, it'll be well worth it to cooperate with them.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Once we depose Okonogi, it'll be a simple matter to proceed with our anti-Republican insurrection.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"But if they plan to betray us, they'll have the perfect chance to round us all up when we storm the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"In that case, the Sworn Blades would be annihilated for good.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"It's still too early to ascertain their true intentions.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Even so, it would be rash to outright refuse.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"We can at least afford to wait to back out until after we get our spellblades back.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well. We'll start by calling on the warriors we're personally familiar with.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, please forgive us for our overabundance of caution.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Hotori and I bow deeply to Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Pay it no mind.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Such wariness is eminently understandable.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"She turns to me and replies with a kindly expression.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Despite being an impostor, she certainly looks the part of a magnanimous Empress.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“One last thing─I have a condition of my own.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The warriors are to report the plans for their uprising to me in complete detail.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No objections.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If there are any discrepancies at all with our own intelligence, we will take appropriate action.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Go right ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you wish, I'll certify our pact today in blood.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Spare me.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why are you warriors always so eager to spill blood anyways?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's what it means to make a vow.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That doesn't explain anything.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please, let's save it for another time...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sorry, just a little joke.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Elsa immediately reassumes a serious expression.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But in the interest of honesty, I'll confess that I truly detest you warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You haven't forgotten how many of my men you've killed, have you?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The feeling is mutual.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"The two glare at each other.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But out of respect for Her Majesty, and in order to create a brighter future for the Empire, I'm willing to treat it all as water under the bridge.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's spare no effort in accomplishing our goals.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Hotori wordlessly reaches out to clasp Elsa's outstretched hand.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Their hands touch for less than a second, barely even qualifying as a handshake.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Empress Hisui silently watches this exchange before standing up for the first time.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What an unexpectedly joyous day this has become.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Inou, Tokita, I am delighted from the bottom of my heart that you have answered my request.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Let us join hands together with Elsa-sama to build a new Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori & Soujin"},
			{
"“Your will be done.” “Your will be done.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Empress Hisui graces our deferential display of genuflection with a nod before sitting back down.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"I suddenly take notice of Empress Hisui's carriage.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"I could have sworn that she stood up and sat down without the slightest shift in her center of gravity.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"This manner of sitting, emulating smoke rising from a pyre, is one that is taught only in warrior society.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"I turn to cast Hotori a sidelong glance, and end up meeting eyes with her instead.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"If we both saw it, then there can be no mistake.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"This girl playing the part of Empress Hisui has undoubtedly received a warrior's upbringing.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"My thoughts are interrupted by a knock on the door.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Looks like our other guests have arrived.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Come on in.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"The door opens, and Akari, Kotone, and Shino all make their way inside.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever brings all of you here?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Why hello there, Miyaguni-san.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your Majesty...”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance once again so soon.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed, the pleasure is all mine.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"The two share a smile.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"It looks like they're already familiar with each other.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, well, what a curious lineup we've got assembled here.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Ummm...”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes are positively spinning as she seemingly struggles to digest the bizarre turn of events.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Truthfully, she's not the only one who's confused here.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now then, why don't we all sit down first and enjoy some nice tea?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Elsa offers seats to the three newcomers and busies herself with preparing the tea.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"In no time at all, each of us has a steaming cup of black tea sitting in front of ourselves.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Let's see what Elsa is capable of.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've prepared only the finest of teas for everyone here today. Please do enjoy.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"We each bring our cups to our lips.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"I've practically never drank black tea before, but I can only describe this as delicious.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"The quality must be just as good as she claims.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, what do you want with us?”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Elsa unhurriedly sets her cup aside.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I wanted to commemorate the first meeting of the new student council, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huuuh?!”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Since when were we in the student council?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, since five minutes ago.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Confused looks are traded all across the conference table.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And why should we have to go along with your little charade?”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Considering the awfully unique lineup you've gathered here, you've got some big plans, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, I've taken the liberty of assembling only the most exemplary students, all of whom carry the future of the Empire on their shoulders.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Elsa, daughter of the governor-general and a senior officer in the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Empress Hisui, the Empire's head of state.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"Kotone, the Exalt-Priestess who stands at the pinnacle of the priesthood.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Hotori, the Executor of the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Shino, the head of the Empire's largest financial conglomerate.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"I'm... along for the ride as Hotori's sidekick... perhaps?",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"As for Akari... I wonder.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"But judging by the way she was talking, there's a good chance that Elsa is already aware of Akari's identity.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The reason I've called you here today is because Empress Hisui seeks your cooperation with a certain plan of hers.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say that it'll shake the very foundations of the Empire and rewrite its entire history.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“By the way, Inou-san, Tokita-kun, not to mention Shino are all already on board.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, that's how it turned out.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shino, you're in on it, too?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm down to go along with anything Her Majesty asks for.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“The Kurushimas are only where they are today because of the Imperial Family's benevolence. I've always been meaning to pay 'em back.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“We are much obliged.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Kurushima, I thank you for your cooperation.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"I don't think I've ever seen Shino bowing this courteously to anyone before.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Er, might I inquire what this plan actually entails?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Elsa repeats the same explanation she gave to us.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It sounds as though it is primarily the warriors who will be taking action, so what precisely is the role I am expected to fulfill?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Psychological ≪aftercare≫ for the Imperial people after the new regime is established.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Once the Imperial institution is abolished, unrest may very well spread among the populace as a result of losing their pillar of emotional support.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That has always been the sworn duty of the priesthood. You may certainly count on my cooperation.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, what do you want me for?”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“From everything I've heard, it doesn't sound like I've got anything to do.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're a warrior too, aren't you? And an awfully influential one, at that.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I can tell from the way you move that you know your way around a blade.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And based on how Inou-san and Tokita-kun act towards you, I somehow doubt you're just part of the rank and file.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Oh, so that's the misunderstanding she's operating under.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"That's awfully convenient for us.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"For now, it's best to just go along with it and avoid giving her any other ideas.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure are observant, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I suppose I'll have to give it my all if Her Majesty is the one asking.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, it seems we have everyone's assent.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Elsa stands up with a satisfied nod.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Slowly circling around the room, she launches into her explanation.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The reason I want you all to join the student council is that it would help move the plan along smoothly.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We'll need to stay in close contact with each other and have a place to meet in private, won't we?”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The student council office was built for my personal needs, so it's well outfitted with communication devices, and there's no danger of it being bugged.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd say it's the perfect place for hatching secret plots.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wouldn't you say, Shino?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"Elsa turns her gaze towards Shino.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yes ma'am, built from the ground up just for that.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Just for the record, the windows are totally bulletproof, and you'd have a real hard time drilling in from above or below.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Even if the school was bombed to smithereens, this room would still be left standing.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That'd be some surreal sight, wouldn't it? This room sitting pretty all by itself in a giant pile of rubble?”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"This school was heavily damaged during the course of the war.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"Because rebuilding it would have been inordinately expensive, it was slated to be closed and demolished.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"However, the Kurushima Group swooped in to buy the whole thing, repairing and refurbishing it from the ground up.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"It's said that their aim was to build up connections with the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"Running a prestigious academy for the children of Republican Army officers would naturally bring the Kurushimas into contact with their parents.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
{"font", size=47},
"Thus, Tenkyo Imperial Academy was transformed from a school for Imperial elites to a site of cultural exchange where Republicans and Imperials could study together under the same roof.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"Helped along by Shino's own experience studying abroad, the Kurushima Group's investment had an easy time attracting the attention of movers and shakers from the Republic.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Meanwhile, to appease Okonogi, it's said the Group bought the school from the Imperial government at a “fair market value.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"It's scary how much money they can afford to throw around without blinking an eye.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now then, as for your positions...”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"Elsa starts outlining the student council positions on the whiteboard.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Naturally, the president is Elsa herself.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I appoint Miyaguni-san and Inou-san as my vice presidents.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shino can be treasurer, and Shiinoha-san, I would like you to be our secretary.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am to be the secretary?”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've seen your handwriting before, and it's very beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I believe you are the perfect candidate for the job.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, not that we write things by hand too often nowadays.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What an honor it is!”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about me?”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I understand if you just want me to sweep the floors. I'll still give it my all.”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun, I want you to serve as Empress Hisui's escort.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's at Her Majesty's personal behest.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It would be an honor, Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am humbly at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"Empress Hisui fixes me with an intense stare.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"It's the same look she gave me even on the day we first met.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"She surely has some reason for specifically requesting me.",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I suppose that still doesn't give you a formal position in the student council, so let's call you our public relations officer.”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"Elsa jots “Public Relations Officer” under the other titles, and next to it, she writes my name using the Republican alphabet.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, is this to your satisfaction?”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"At Elsa's prompting, Empress Hisui meets all of our eyes with a nod, very much acting the part of a leader.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am delighted from the bottom of my heart that all of you have offered your assent to this proposal of mine.”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“May we all join hands together and build a new government under which all our peoples may live in peace and prosperity.”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As the facilitator of today's first meeting, I'm relieved that\nwe're all on the same page.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Personally, I don't think I could've asked for a better squad.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let us work to pave the way towards a brighter future for the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"Elsa ends her speech with an emphatic flourish, seeming for all the world like a noble officer rousing her men to battle.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"We took part in this plot with no intention to see it through to its conclusion, but just how committed is she to this alliance?",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"We'll need to carefully watch her every move from now on.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, I forgot to mention this earlier, but I'll need you to do the regular student council work, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The workload is... Well, I'm sure members as talented as yourselves shouldn't have any issues.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...This is news to me.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's because I didn't mention it until now.”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"She says it so nonchalantly...",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In terms of upcoming events, the only major challenge will be the school-wide field trip to the beach.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Expecting warriors to plan a field trip...”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"Hotori groans out her displeasure, but Elsa once again displays her impressive ability to turn a deaf ear.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now that that's settled, let's decide on a proper name for this plan of ours.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's imperative for every military operation to have a fitting name.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't think we need one.”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Im-per-a-tive!”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, I got a head start yesterday with some brainstorming!”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			{
"Elsa excitedly pulls out her cell phone.",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"She sure gets passionate about the strangest things...",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			{
"“Operation Eastern Dawn.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			{
"“Operation Summer Storm.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"“Operation Immortal Truth.”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"“Operation Dragon's Claw.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"“Operation Sacred Bullet.”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"“Operation Thunderlord's Wrath,” and the list goes on.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Th-Those are some awfully colorful names...”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, the morale of the unit positively depends on it!”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			{
"Elsa seems way too proud of herself.",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry, they're all way too cringey.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now listen here. Do you know how long I spent coming up with these!?”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You haven't changed one bit since officer school, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Glad to see you're still having fun at least.”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, shut it, you.”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you're just gonna complain, let's see you come up with anything better.”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Operation Alpha.”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Operation Bee.”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Operation Three!”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Boooring! Overruled!”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Who gives a crap if the operation name is boring?!”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Like I said, the morale of the unit─”",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All right, all right! Enough fighting, you two!”",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			{
"Akari intervenes between them.",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's have Her Majesty make the final decision.”",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"Empress Hisui, who'd been silently watching up until now, flinches with a start.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure Her Majesty will be able to come up with a wonderful name.”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No objections here.”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			{
"All of our attention focuses towards Her Majesty.",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Very well. Allow me to consider.”",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"Empress Hisui intently squeezes her eyes shut.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			{
"A bead of sweat trickles down her brow.",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			{
"She looks the very picture of composure, but it seems like\nshe's actually fairly flustered.",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Eureka!”",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			{
"After a long thirty seconds, Her Majesty finally snaps her eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I hereby decree that this plan...”",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...shall be named Operation Bellflower.”",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			{
"Operation Bellflower, huh?",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			{
"The autumn bellflower is the flower of House Tokita's family seal.",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"As I picture my family's seal in my head, Hotori shoots me a meaningful look.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"We already suspected Empress Hisui of having a warrior's upbringing, and now here she is bringing up the flower of House Tokita.",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"There's definitely more to her than meets the eye.",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What a beautiful name.”",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's the Empress for you!”",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Some real silk-stocking sensibilities right there.”",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			{
"Naturally, there are no objections, and the name of our operation is finalized as Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am pleased that you are all in favor.”",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Let us all endeavor to make Operation Bellflower a success.”",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			{
"Everyone nods in agreement.",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“By the way, do warriors have any sort of ritual to commemorate a pledge like this?”",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We have the Ringing, where we strike our sheaths with our blades.”",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"It's a regular tradition within the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm afraid I don't have a blade on hand...”",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, why don't we make a toast with our tea?”",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, finally my time to shine.”",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"Kotone proudly strides around the room and diligently refills each of our cups.",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's not part of the secretary's job description to serve us tea, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, no, ma'am, this is the least that I can do.”",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Um, like I said, you're the secreta─”",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aaah!”",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			{
"Kotone's sleeve catches on the edge of Elsa's cup, sending it flying.",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			{
"Elsa barely manages to avoid getting a faceful of hot tea thanks to her quick reflexes.",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawawawa, I'm terribly sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“First the cafeteria, and now here as well... Will you not rest until you've spilled a drink on me?”",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			{
"Come to think of it, Kotone did spill milk on Elsa in the cafeteria as well.",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“S-Surely you jest!”",
			},
		},
		[413]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, I may have caused you many an inconvenience, but...”",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Heh, hehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You are certainly as amusing as ever, Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[416]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This is no laughing matter!”",
			},
		},
		[417]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh, I apologize...”",
			},
		},
		[418]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Members of the student council ought to serve as role models for the rest of the student body.”",
			},
		},
		[419]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As for you... I'll be sure to whip you into shape under my personal supervision.”",
			},
		},
		[420]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Any objections, Your Eminence?”",
			},
		},
		[421]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“None... Incompetent though I may be, I look forward to your tutelage...”",
			},
		},
		[422]={
			{
"Kotone lowers her forehead all the way down to the table that she's still frantically trying to wipe clean.",
			},
		},
		[423]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess, the supreme prelate of the Tento faith, the paragon of saintly virtue standing above all those in the priesthood...",
			},
		},
		[424]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Is it really okay for Her Eminence to be doing this?)”",
			},
		},
		[425]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Don't ask me...)”",
			},
		},
		[426]={
			{
"...Is currently trying her best to hold back her tears as she pours Elsa another cup of tea with trembling hands.",
			},
		},
		[427]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now then, a toast, shall we?”",
			},
		},
		[428]={
			{
"Elsa raises her cup.",
			},
		},
		[429]={
			{
"The rest of us follow suit.",
			},
		},
		[430]={
			{
"These Republican-style teacups are impossible to hold with their dainty handles...",
			},
		},
		[431]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“To the future of the school and the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[432]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To the future of the school and the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[433]={
			{
"With some difficulty, I manage to raise my cup and take a sip of its contents.",
			},
		},
		[434]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ack!”",
			},
		},
		[435]={
			{
"I turn to find Empress Hisui sticking out her tiny tongue after recoiling from her hot tea.",
			},
		},
		[436]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah...?”",
			},
		},
		[437]={
			{
"Upon meeting my gaze, she immediately closes her mouth, her cheeks flushing a bright red.",
			},
		},
		[438]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah, I had forgotten to mention this.”",
			},
		},
		[439]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In the course of our discussions, I would sincerely ask that you ignore the fact that I am the Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[440]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You need not give any special consideration to my opinions merely because they come from me.”",
			},
		},
		[441]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please feel free to express your honest agreement or dissent with anything that I may say.”",
			},
		},
		[442]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You got it.”",
			},
		},
		[443]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've never been one to stand on ceremony either, so that's a big relief.”",
			},
		},
		[444]={
			{
"Akari cheerfully replies with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[445]={
			{
"She seems to get along well with Empress Hisui, at least on the surface. On the inside, however─",
			},
		},
		[446]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now you've gone and said it, you faker.”",
			},
